@host = http://localhost:5015

### JSON (за замовчуванням)
GET {{host}}/products/1
Accept: application/json

### XML — той самий ресурс, інший формат
GET {{host}}/products/1
Accept: application/xml

### Формат, якого немає → 406
GET {{host}}/products/1
Accept: text/csv

### Умовний GET: підставте ETag із попередньої відповіді → 304
GET {{host}}/products/1
If-None-Match: W/"1-1"

### PUT без If-Match → 428 Precondition Required
PUT {{host}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X1 Carbon", "price": 1700, "categoryId": 1, "sku": "LAP-X1C-14" }

### PUT зі свіжим ETag → 200
PUT {{host}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: W/"1-1"

{ "name": "X1 Carbon (updated)", "price": 1700, "categoryId": 1, "sku": "LAP-X1C-14" }

### JSON Patch (RFC 6902)
PATCH {{host}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  { "op": "replace", "path": "/price", "value": 1234.50 },
  { "op": "replace", "path": "/description", "value": "ціну знижено" }
]

### JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386)
PATCH {{host}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json

{ "price": 999 }
